  "why_negative_result_not_proven": [
    "Schema V2 contains multiple structured and open string-valued semantically typed carriers that can participate in compositions.",
    "The reviewed admissibility rule requires semantically related carriers but does not provide a complete machine-readable relation enumerating every admissible V4-field-to-Schema-V2-carrier composition.",
    "Therefore all admissible semantically related multi-field compositions cannot currently be machine-enumerated and exhaustively eliminated.",
    "Absence of a same-named property is not treated as proof that no admissible structured composition exists."
  ],
  "why_positive_result_not_proven": [
    "No complete constructive analysis-only witness currently maps every V4 semantic unit into native semantically related Schema-V2 carriers.",
    "No complete candidate currently passes deterministic exact forward encoding and deterministic exact reverse reconstruction for every V4 semantic unit.",
    "Complete collision-freedom and semantic-noninterference have not been demonstrated for a full existing-V2 mapping."
  ]
}
